          "settings": {
            "heading": "10 Year Restoration",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>We recommend to ship the duvet back to us every ten years for complete <a href=\"https://www.norvegr.com/lifetime-products/\">restoration</a>. The down inside these duvets is very durable and can be restored up to five times without the quality decreasing – thereby lasting at least 60 years if maintained properly.</p><p>The restoration cost is the retail price at time of restoration, divided by four. Shipping back and forth is extra, but thanks to a generous discount with our courier, costs are modest. We will gladly help arrange your product’s return to make the process as effortless as possible for you.</p>",
