            "bigger_margin": false,
            "caption": "What kind of down is used?",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Filled with among the best commercially available types of goose down there are, our Premium Collection duvets are our second best goose down duvets.<br/><br/>This luxury down is 100% European White Goose down - completely feather free. On the fill power scale, these duvets are 850, which is the highest one can acquire among commercially available down qualities.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
